Chaofeng,

 

It 
doesn't quite give everything you need in the same format, but if you use 

VarCorr(dental.fit) 

you 
will get the variance estimates as well as the correlations.  Just multiply 
these correlations by their respective SD's and you have the covariance 
estimates.  Beyond this, you may have to ask Doug 
Bates.

 

Hope 
this Helps,

Kyle

 

